# Normalise line endings so the repository behaves the same on Windows, macOS and Linux.
#
# Why this matters: Git for Windows may check files out with CRLF line endings. Python, SQL and Markdown
# tolerate that, but shell scripts and Dockerfiles copied into Linux containers do NOT
# ("cannot execute: required file not found"). Forcing LF in the working tree avoids the problem.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never touch line endings.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.m4a binary
*.ogg binary
*.webm binary
*.flac binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
